        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://shawneehillsoh.org/community/history",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "An agreement with Columbus in the 1990s paved the way for a sewer system that now serves the village’s dense grid of lots.",
